{"name":"The Call Lamp","slug":"glyph-call-lamp","blurb":"On the transform street, Pim carries the lamp toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Call. Click the lamp and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Call Lamp.","seal":"c9a2135321c0dfc720bb50828d38ef3ce2fa5bcb6ce082cb2f055bfbf18fb545"}
